## Notes for the raise (not for the model)

- **Scope:** the ticket says "`deployment/DEPLOYMENT-ARCHITECTURE.md` (and any deploy runbook)". This
  covers the named file only. `deployment/KINTSUGI-REBUILD-RUNBOOK.md` (merged later, #943) is a
  SCHEMA-FIRST whole-estate rebuild — Phase 3 `up -d --force-recreate migrations` BEFORE Phase 4's
  per-service `up -d --force-recreate <service>` (`:233-257`) — so "migrations last" does not apply to
  it, and its Phase 4 without `--no-deps` only re-runs an already-applied migrations container. Whether
  that runbook should also say `--no-deps` is a reviewer's call; not touched here.
- **Same file as KS-987's brief** (same batch), disjoint regions: KS-987 inserts after `:73`, KS-890 after
  `:96`. Each applies alone at the tip; the second to merge re-anchors.
